[{"title":"风逆","author":"陶安","text":"浪激船头上苦迟，无端又被逆风吹。\n桐城山在江西畔，三日相随尚不离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32882,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋浦西郭","author":"陶安","text":"天风招我游池阳，飞步郭西千仞冈。\n笑挹九华颜色好，怪来衣似绿荷香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32883,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻友人童溺","author":"陶安","text":"马前曾佩锦囊行，笑指风烟一舸轻。\n月冷江天无觅处，别随仙客去骑鲸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32884,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓发","author":"陶安","text":"月出山头近四更，急呼人起棹船行。\n荡摇枕席咿哑去，卧听江声直到明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32885,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"那吒石","author":"陶安","text":"何处飞来臂有翰，峰头毛发照波寒。\n不知元是那吒石，误作巫山十二看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32886,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李杨河","author":"陶安","text":"顺风帆过李杨河，河北平矶没浅波。\n快拨轻舟绝江去，大龙山远小如螺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32887,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拦江矶","author":"陶安","text":"朝来东北好风生，吹得云帆似叶轻。\n稳向拦江矶觜过，怒涛喷薄不须惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32888,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赵老洲","author":"陶安","text":"杯茶未了过黄湓，赵老洲平不见村。\n舟子指西微笑说，不消一会到城门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32889,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浊酒","author":"陶安","text":"浊醪杯面涨桃花，雪后阳春满一槎。\n醉里若逢年少日，更攀北斗酌流霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32890,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至安庆闻廖玉溪宪副等东下","author":"陶安","text":"李郭仙舟不可攀，我来惆怅夕阳间。\n料得对床篷底话，顺流一夜到龙湾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32891,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发安庆二首 其一","author":"陶安","text":"城头云重月色黑，唯见空江如镜明。\n舟子笑谈谙熟路，扬帆夜半趁风行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32892,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发安庆二首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"细浪声喧画桨闲，游龙载梦过淮山。\n觉来忘却江行稳，疑在松风万壑间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32893,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词四首","author":"陶安","text":"昨夜床头灯结花，朝来浣女立江沙。\n洗得纻衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32894,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望东流","author":"陶安","text":"千嶂浮空翠入舟，乱云堆里指东流。\n无缘结得烟霞伴，架屋松风最上头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32895,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蛾眉洲梦觉","author":"陶安","text":"清梦回时短发搔，百年身世寄轻舠。\n夜深浪静鱼龙蛰，天地无声一枕高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32896,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晨起","author":"陶安","text":"水国无鸡报五更，霜鹅笼里戛然鸣。\n一声惊破篙师梦，樯上疏星挂晓晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32897,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓望","author":"陶安","text":"水气昏冥凝白烟，恍如混沌未开天。\n腾腾冷雾笼初日，冻作轻冰一朵圆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32898,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"烽火矶二首 其一","author":"陶安","text":"万章松桧百年霜，石笋穿波翠有铓。\n愿得边烽从此息，桑麻绿满战争场。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32899,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"烽火矶二首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"撑破苍霄顶额雄，通身峭石挂玲珑。\n草木不知危险处，直于绝壁长高丛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32900,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"彭郎矶","author":"陶安","text":"巨灵运起霹雳斧，斫去巉岩当面平。\n想为小孤无伴侣，夹江对立一般清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32901,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"补陀岩","author":"陶安","text":"峭壁飞亭起十层，螺弯石路小如绳。\n老僧独坐云深处，山鬼冲寒夜剔灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32902,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写情四首 其一","author":"陶安","text":"海船如山风力轻，十朝难得一朝行。\n少妇颦眉两相语，几时到得豫章城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32903,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写情四首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"豫章城边江水清，城中新屋起军营。\n人人盼望妻儿到，日日走从江岸迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32904,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写情四首 其三","author":"陶安","text":"新人颜色美如花，旧妇携儿今到家。\n闺中同骂郎轻薄，何不当初等候些。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32905,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写情四首 其四","author":"陶安","text":"年少儿郎久不归，营中长夜守孤帏。\n馀粮买得绫丝绢，留待妻来裁作衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32906,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂谣六首 其一","author":"陶安","text":"东南风起水流东，折转双帆横使风。\n莫言不及顺风速，还胜撑篙急浪中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32907,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂谣六首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"船住堤边同采薪，船行炊饭日初晨。\n众喜涌沙船得脱，烹鹅酾酒赛江神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32908,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂谣六首 其三","author":"陶安","text":"新觅篙师两少年，默然无语静行船。\n同来黄帽欠谙练，每日喧争聒耳边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32909,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂谣六首 其四","author":"陶安","text":"两个渔舟烟水中，见我相违如燕鸿。\n生怕军来觅鱼蟹，不知船里载诗翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32910,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂谣六首 其五","author":"陶安","text":"来往船儿都起篷，天公那有两家风。\n上流不及下流速，安得人心喜一同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32911,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂谣六首 其六","author":"陶安","text":"雨淘沙碛炫银色，浪打石根如斧痕。\n近日船军少登岸，松山窝处已成村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32912,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"径江三首 其一","author":"陶安","text":"水落江心露碧沙，铁戈西向插如麻。\n重来战卒寻遗迹，拾得花镔甲到家。","col